        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game <i>Pot!</i>, players embark on a challenging adventure. You’ll navigate through intricate levels by flexibly controlling the character's movement and rolling to avoid dangers. Use unique-function pots to destroy obstacles and defeat enemies, and finally claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you start the game, it’s a brand-new random adventure: you’ll get a random unique-function pot right at the beginning, and the map routes are always full of unknowns and variables. Choose a safe path with balanced risk and reward, or take a high-risk route full of dangers but with generous rewards — all decisions are up to you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/77190c149832e165e305a2b7d06d17b5.poster.avif?t=1763608389\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/77190c149832e165e305a2b7d06d17b5.webm?t=1763608389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/77190c149832e165e305a2b7d06d17b5.mp4?t=1763608389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more aggressive your playstyle, the faster your growth pace. Strengthen your pot to the fullest, making it powerful enough to destroy all obstacles in your way!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/da37a3e8fefdb0599fdbc5e30fb23db9.poster.avif?t=1763608389\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/da37a3e8fefdb0599fdbc5e30fb23db9.webm?t=1763608389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/da37a3e8fefdb0599fdbc5e30fb23db9.mp4?t=1763608389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The special modules in the game each have completely different functions. When you embed them into the pot one by one, these modules will interact with each other to unleash brand-new combat effects — helping you &quot;crush monsters&quot; easily with fancy strategies!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/e53a0fe511d226d2ce573ad8305c4b18.poster.avif?t=1763608389\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/e53a0fe511d226d2ce573ad8305c4b18.webm?t=1763608389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/e53a0fe511d226d2ce573ad8305c4b18.mp4?t=1763608389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bo Coins! They are the hard currency of this world. As for the Bo Coins you collect, you must keep an eye on the store's location in real time — don’t run into a store when you’re empty-handed, and never miss it when you have plenty of Bo Coins. The powerful items sold in the store are often &quot;game-changers&quot; that can save your life, so be sure to buy them when you get the chance!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/c4f18d239f55fc1974c4fb4b25bfb9aa.poster.avif?t=1763608389\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/c4f18d239f55fc1974c4fb4b25bfb9aa.webm?t=1763608389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/c4f18d239f55fc1974c4fb4b25bfb9aa.mp4?t=1763608389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game <i>Pot!</i>, players embark on a challenging adventure. You’ll navigate through intricate levels by flexibly controlling the character's movement and rolling to avoid dangers. Use unique-function pots to destroy obstacles and defeat enemies, and finally claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you start the game, it’s a brand-new random adventure: you’ll get a random unique-function pot right at the beginning, and the map routes are always full of unknowns and variables. Choose a safe path with balanced risk and reward, or take a high-risk route full of dangers but with generous rewards — all decisions are up to you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/77190c149832e165e305a2b7d06d17b5.poster.avif?t=1763608389\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/77190c149832e165e305a2b7d06d17b5.webm?t=1763608389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/77190c149832e165e305a2b7d06d17b5.mp4?t=1763608389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more aggressive your playstyle, the faster your growth pace. Strengthen your pot to the fullest, making it powerful enough to destroy all obstacles in your way!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/da37a3e8fefdb0599fdbc5e30fb23db9.poster.avif?t=1763608389\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/da37a3e8fefdb0599fdbc5e30fb23db9.webm?t=1763608389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/da37a3e8fefdb0599fdbc5e30fb23db9.mp4?t=1763608389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The special modules in the game each have completely different functions. When you embed them into the pot one by one, these modules will interact with each other to unleash brand-new combat effects — helping you &quot;crush monsters&quot; easily with fancy strategies!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/e53a0fe511d226d2ce573ad8305c4b18.poster.avif?t=1763608389\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/e53a0fe511d226d2ce573ad8305c4b18.webm?t=1763608389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/e53a0fe511d226d2ce573ad8305c4b18.mp4?t=1763608389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bo Coins! They are the hard currency of this world. As for the Bo Coins you collect, you must keep an eye on the store's location in real time — don’t run into a store when you’re empty-handed, and never miss it when you have plenty of Bo Coins. The powerful items sold in the store are often &quot;game-changers&quot; that can save your life, so be sure to buy them when you get the chance!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/c4f18d239f55fc1974c4fb4b25bfb9aa.poster.avif?t=1763608389\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/c4f18d239f55fc1974c4fb4b25bfb9aa.webm?t=1763608389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857670/extras/c4f18d239f55fc1974c4fb4b25bfb9aa.mp4?t=1763608389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
